      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emden%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Early pioneer William Scully, alongside blacksmith Teis Smid, is credited with laying the groundwork for Emden’s first community.",
